# Names without the UTF-8 flag are code page 437; libarchive decodes them, hold hands back the bytes (Entry.encoding = .cp437) until xenoglyph decodes CP437 (Tycho, 2026-10-25). The fourth name is taken from its Unicode Path field, whose CRC matches the central name (APPNOTE 4.6.9); libarchive takes the local name.
# 7-Zip and Windows writers store the exact NTFS time; libarchive reads the two-second DOS time beside it (and as local time), hold the NTFS time.
